- 錯誤訊息：`[object Object]/emogo_exported_data.json` 證明了這點

**修正方法：**
```javascript
// ❌ 錯誤：把物件當字串用
const filePath = `${Paths.document}/${fileName}`;
const file = new File(filePath);

// ✅ 正確：File 建構子接收 (directory, filename)
const documentDir = Paths.document;  // Directory 物件
const file = new File(documentDir, fileName);
```

